## Award Winners

One award recipient in a tournament. Join the award, recipient and tournament IDs.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|------|--------------|------|-------------|--------------|
| key_id | Row Key | integer | Source row key; not a person, team or tournament identity. | key_id |
| tournament_id | Tournament ID | string | Stable tournament identifier; join using this value. | tournament_id |
| tournament_name | Tournament Name | string | Recorded tournament name. | tournament_name |
| award_id | Award ID | string | Stable award identifier; join using this value. | award_id |
| award_name | Award Name | string | Recorded award name. | award_name |
| shared | Shared Rank | integer | 1 when the recorded position is shared, otherwise 0. | shared |
| player_id | Player ID | string | Stable player identifier; join using this value. | player_id |
| family_name | Family Name | string | Recorded family name; use the person ID to identify a unique individual. | family_name |
| given_name | Given Name | string | Recorded given name, preserving source spelling and accents. | given_name |
| team_id | Team ID | string | Stable team identifier; join using this value. | team_id |
| team_name | Team Name | string | Recorded team name. | team_name |
| team_code | Team Code | string | Recorded team code. | team_code |

